Package: RAISE
Type: Package
Title: R with AI for Statistical Education (RAISE): AI-Powered Statistics Exam Question Generator
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Benedikt", "Langenberg", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "benedikt.langenberg@gmail.com")
Description: Generates realistic exam questions grounded in simulated
    statistical output. Uses an LLM agent to design hypothetical studies,
    simulate datasets in R, and produce regression output that anchors exam
    questions. Any chat provider supported by 'ellmer' can be used (Anthropic
    Claude by default); lecture materials can be searched with BM25 or with
    any embedding provider supported by 'ragnar'. Questions can include
    figures and are exported to PDF, Canvas, TestVision and Markdown via
    'exams'. The Shiny interface ('shinychat') guides lecturers through study
    creation and question generation workflows.
